@api = http://localhost:8080

### API health
GET {{api}}/health

### Create an order; automatically stages its outbox event in the same DbContext
POST {{api}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "BOOK-001",
  "quantity": 2
}

### See orders
GET {{api}}/orders

### See outbox attempts / publish status
GET {{api}}/outbox

### Simulate publisher outage
POST {{api}}/demo/faults/publisher/down

### Restore publisher
POST {{api}}/demo/faults/publisher/up

### Inject post-confirmation failure on next publish
POST {{api}}/demo/faults/fail-after-publish-once
